-cite-backlink" id="mwB0A"><a href="#cite_ref-4" data-mw-group="Note" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwB0E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwB0I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-4" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="Note">Exact value: <span class="nowrap" id="mwB0M">(<span class="nowrap" id="mwB0Q"><span data-sort-value="7008299792458000000♠" id="mwB0U"></span>299<span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB0Y">792</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB0c">458</span></span> × <span class="nowrap" id="mwB0g"><span data-sort-value="7004864000000000000♠" id="mwB0k"></span>86<span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB0o">400</span></span> / <span class="nowrap" id="mwB0s"><span data-sort-value="7011149597870700000♠" id="mwB0w"></span>149<span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB00">597</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB04">870</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB08">700</span></span>) AU/day</span>.</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-5" id="cite_note-5" data-mw-footnote-number="2"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwB1A"><a href="#cite_ref-5" data-mw-group="Note" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwB1E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwB1I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-5" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="Note">Exact value: <span class="nowrap" id="mwB1M">(<span class="nowrap" id="mwB1Q"><span data-sort-value="7008999992651000000♠" id="mwB1U"></span>999<span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB1Y">992</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB1c">651</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwB1g"> </span><span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" id="mwB1k">π</span></span> / <span class="nowrap" id="mwB1o"><span data-sort-value="7010102464295000000♠" id="mwB1s"></span>10<span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB1w">246</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB10">429</span><span style="margin-left:.25em;" id="mwB14">500</span></span>) pc/y</span>.</span></li>
</ol></div>

