167-A</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OSTI_(identifier)" title="OSTI (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwCmQ">OSTI</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwCmU"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.osti.gov/biblio/1449261" class="external text" id="mwCmY">1449261</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Physics+Letters+B&amp;rft.atitle=Causality+between+conducting+plates&amp;rft.volume=250&amp;rft.issue=%3Cspan+class%3D%22nowrap%22%3E1%E2%80%93%3C%2Fspan%3E2&amp;rft.pages=133-138&amp;rft.date=1990-11&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2F0370-2693%2890%2991167-A&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.osti.gov%2Fbiblio%2F1449261%23id-name%3DOSTI&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1990PhLB..250..133B&amp;rft.aulast=Ben-Menahem&amp;rft.aufirst=Shahar&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Flinkinghub.elsevier.com%2Fretrieve%2Fpii%2F037026939091167A&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASpeed+of+light" class="Z3988" about="#mwt315" id="mwCmc"></span></li>
