:Entity" id="mwC1k"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-1-943-58004-0" title="Special:BookSources/978-1-943-58004-0" id="mwC1o"><bdi id="mwC1s">978-1-943-58004-0</bdi></a>. <q id="mwC1w">[I]t was natural to dream that quantum correlations could be used for faster-than-light communication, but this speculation was quickly shot down, and the shooting established the principle that quantum states cannot be copied.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Quantum+Information+Science%3A+Emerging+No+More&amp;rft.btitle=OSA+Century+of+Optics&amp;rft.pages=320-326&amp;rft.pub=Optica&amp;rft.date=2015&amp;rft_id=info%3Aarxiv%2F1302.1864&amp;rft.isbn=978-1-943-58004-0&amp;rft.aulast=Caves&amp;rft.aufirst=Carlton+M.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASpeed+of+light" class="Z3988" about="#mwt378" id="mwC10"></span></li></ul></span></li>
