<li id="mwDTs"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt489" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwDTw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Cite web\n ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Dumé"},"first":{"wt":"B."},"year":{"wt":"2003"},"title":{"wt":"Switching light on and off"},"url":{"wt":"http://physicsworld.com/cws/article/news/18724"},"work":{"wt":"[[Physics World]]"},"publisher":{"wt":"Institute of Physics"},"access-date":{"wt":"8 December 2008"},"archive-date":{"wt":"5 December 2008"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20081205051203/http://physicsworld.com/cws/article/news/18724"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFDumé2003" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt489">Dumé, B. (2003). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20081205051203/http://physicsworld.com/cws/article/news/18724" class="external text" id="mwDT0">"Switching light on and off"</a>. <i id="mwDT4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Physics_World" title="Physics World" id="mwDT8">Physics World</a></i>. Institute of Physics. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://physicsworld.com/cws/article/news/18724" class="external text" id="mwDUA">the original</a> on 5 December 2008<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwDUE">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwDUI">8 December</span> 2008</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Physics+World&amp;rft.atitle=Switching+light+on+and+off&amp;rft.date=2003&amp;rft.aulast=Dum%C3%A9&amp;rft.aufirst=B.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fphysicsworld.com%2Fcws%2Farticle%2Fnews%2F18724&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ASpeed+of+light" class="Z3988" about="#mwt489" id="mwDUM"></span></li></ul></span></li>
