The account published in <span title="French-language text" about="#mwt603" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDsY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"fr"},"2":{"wt":"Journal des sçavans"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="fr" id="mwDsc">Journal des sçavans</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_French-language_text" about="#mwt603" id="mwDsg"/> was based on a report that Rømer read to the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Academy_of_Sciences" title="French Academy of Sciences" id="mwDsk">French Academy of Sciences</a> in November 1676 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#cohen-1940" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwDso">(Cohen, 1940, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwDss"> </span>346)</a>.</span></li>
