<li id="mwEzY"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.bipm.org/en/si/si_brochure/chapter2/2-1/metre.html" class="external text" id="mwEzc">Definition of the metre</a> (International Bureau of Weights and Measures, BIPM)</li>
<li id="mwEzg"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/cuu/Value?c" class="external text" id="mwEzk">Speed of light in vacuum</a> (National Institute of Standards and Technology, NIST)</li>
<li id="mwEzo"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20040530221051/http://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/bayesian/datagall/michelso.htm" class="external text" id="mwEzs">Data Gallery: Michelson Speed of Light (Univariate Location Estimation)</a> (download data gathered by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_A._Michelson" title="Albert A. Michelson" id="mwEzw">Albert A. Michelson</a>)</li>
