<li id="mwE0o"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.sciencealert.com/simple-animations-by-a-nasa-scientist-prove-the-speed-of-light-is-torturously-slow" class="external text" id="mwE0s">Speed of Light – animated demonstrations</a></li>
<li id="mwE0w">"<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://books.google.com/books?id=p4o9AQAAIAAJ" class="external text" id="mwE00">The Velocity of Light</a>", Albert A. Nicholson, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scientific_American" title="Scientific American" id="mwE04">Scientific American</a>, 28 September 1878, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwE08"> </span>193</li></ul>

