href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:Relativity" title="Special:EditPage/Template:Relativity"><abbr title="Edit this template">e</abbr></a></li></ul></div><div id="Relativity7299" style="font-size:114%;margin:0 4em"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theory_of_relativity" title="Theory of relativity">Relativity</a></div></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="navbox-group" style="text-align:center;;width:1%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_relativity" title="Special relativity">Special<br/>relativity</a></th><td class="navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-odd hlist" style="width:100%;padding:0"><div style="padding:0 0.25em"></div><table class="nowraplinks navbox-subgroup" style="border-spacing:0"><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="navbox-group" style="width:6em;text-align:center;">Background</th><td class="navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-odd" style="padding:0"><div style="padding:0 0.25em">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Principle_of_relativity" title="Principle of relativity">Principle of relativity</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galilean_invariance" title="Galilean invariance">Galilean relativity</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galilean_transformation" title="Galilean transformation">Galilean transformation</a>)</li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_relativity" title="Special relativity">Special relativity</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doubly_special_relativity" title="Doubly special relativity">Doubly special relativity</a></li></ul>
</div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="navbox-group" style="width:6em;text-align:center;">Fundamental<br/>concepts</th><td class="navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-even" style="padding:0"><div style="padding:0 0.25em">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frame_of_reference" title="Frame of reference">Frame of reference</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Speed_of_light" class="mw-selflink selflink">Speed of light</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyperbolic_orthogonality" title="Hyperbolic orthogonality">Hyperbolic orthogonality</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rapidity" title="Rapidity">Rapidity</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maxwell's_equations" title="Maxwell's equations">Maxwell's equations</a></li>
